      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Psychological biases—confusing intelligence with consciousness, human exceptionalism, and exponential-growth or techno-rapture thinking—make people wrongly see consciousness in AI systems.",
      "question": "conscious AI — why do people mistakenly believe machines are already conscious? (four biases)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
