      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-yverz7",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "The Ethics Of Creating Conscious Machines",
      "gist": "Deliberately creating conscious AI would risk a moral disaster by introducing new beings capable of suffering, and granting them rights would limit our ability to control or shut them down."
    },
