      ],
      "title": "Actually Conscious Versus Conscious-Seeming",
      "gist": "Separate from whether AI is really conscious, machines that merely seem conscious, as Lemoine believed of LaMDA, raise their own ethical dilemmas about misplaced rights and distorted moral concern, now noticed by AI leaders."
    },
